<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Transport - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Transport - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		102.07		vs	   99.57</p>
<p> Operating	    2.47		vs	    2.32</p>
<p> Current		2.50		vs	    2.61</p>
<p> Net		  978    million    vs	    1.09</p>
<p> EPS		    8.81 yen	  vs	    9.91 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    112 million	  vs	 110 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hitachi Transport System Ltd is a distribution company and a member of the Hitachi group.</p>
